Cael meets the owner (vision M10 §10, P0): his one tool, `shape_agent`.

Cael, the guide, gets to know a new owner and gives their agent who it is: its
name, its soul in a few paragraphs from what they told him, and what it knows
about them. The tool from the overlay (crates/caelza-tools/src/shape_agent.rs)
is declared, attributed, listed, registered for Cael alone, given its line in
the prompt's tool list and its row in the docs' table. His risk profile
(written by the app, the dashboard and model-setup.sh) allows that tool and no
other.

